<title>PERU: Peru's banks and markets to be closed on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Peru's banks and markets to be closed on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's banks and financial markets will remain closed on Tuesday for a national holiday marking the 1879 Battle of Angamos during a war with Chile.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Lima Newsroom 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
